83. MOVIEBOX / ZST INTEGRATION

Use the existing VEYRA service architecture.

Do not blindly copy the third-party MovieBox API repository into the frontend.

The intended architecture is:

VEYRA Android
      ↓
VEYRA Backend
      ↓
Authorized MovieBox/ZST service
      ↓
Catalog / Media / Streams
      ↓
VEYRA Player

The frontend must communicate with the VEYRA-controlled API layer.

Do not expose provider credentials.

